10. @PostMapping   - Handles HTTP Post Request. Not Idempotent
                     Used to create new resources or submit data.
11. @PutMapping    - Handles HTTP Put Request. Idempotent
                     Used to update or replace an Existing resource
12. @DeleteMapping - Handles HTTP Delete Request. Idempotent
                     Used to delete the resource

